lenovo-d330-fix (5.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v5.0 full hardware parity package.
  * Added IPU3 camera pipeline and libcamera 3A tuning profiles.
  * Added ZRAM memory compression and eMMC 5.1 storage elevator tuning.
  * Added PipeWire speaker DSP filter-chain and anti-pop power latency.
  * Added ideapad_laptop VPC2004 CLI and state persistence.
  * Added display ergonomics, 1000Hz PWM frequency, and calibrated ICC profile.
  * Added early fbcon rotation, Plymouth hook, and DSDT CPIO override.
  * Added sensor hysteresis, active pen gestures, MicroSD, and auto-hibernate.

